1
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:25,339
I trim the stems of lilies in the cold,

2
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,210
And search for cornflowers of cobalt blue.

3
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:34,500
While green leaves shower on the stone-cold floor,

4
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:39,969
My mind drifts back to where I stood with you.

5
00:00:42,869 --> 00:00:49,439
The rumba echoes softly in my head,

6
00:00:53,039 --> 00:01:00,039
Your warm hand anchored gently on my spine.

7
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:09,799
No push, no claim, no cold control like Mark,

8
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:19,500
Just a quiet spark that starts to shine.

9
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:26,180
I wrap the eucalyptus in paper tight,

10
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:31,049
And wipe the soil from my apron green.

11
00:01:31,939 --> 00:01:36,939
I see your damp wet hair, your shy bright smile,

12
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:41,000
The softest light that I have ever seen.

13
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:50,890
You treat me like a fragile piece of glass,

14
00:01:54,000 --> 00:02:01,049
So gentle, warm, and never in a rush.

15
00:02:04,390 --> 00:02:11,169
The wall of ice I built begins to melt,

16
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:21,759
Turning my quiet thoughts into a blush.

17
00:02:23,099 --> 00:02:27,860
Between the buckets in this chilly room,

18
00:02:28,150 --> 00:02:33,250
I wonder if you're counting hours too.

19
00:02:33,460 --> 00:02:38,360
My silent living room sits dark and still,

20
00:02:39,069 --> 00:02:45,569
Waiting for the day I welcome you.

21
00:02:45,949 --> 00:02:52,509
I make a quiet promise to myself,

22
00:02:56,169 --> 00:03:03,080
Beyond the rules, beyond the studio door.

23
00:03:06,330 --> 00:03:13,129
I'll let you cross the threshold to my home,

24
00:03:15,789 --> 00:03:21,289
And be much more than partners on the floor.